### Checked and NOT gaps

- **sCollision (0x239E0)** — intentionally not snapshotted. Doc conclusion
  (sCollision_hit_primitives_map.md §Phase-1): BVHs + NodeLists **self-heal
  within 1 frame** from correct cChr/uShot state; counts are zeroed each
  `sCollision__move`; restoring its 246 heap buffer ptrs would dangle. Resim
  re-runs `sCollision__move` (rollback.cpp VTableCall +0x401a0), so downstream
  state regenerates.
- **sAction 0x300 over-save** — actual body is 0x250; the extra 0xB0 is a
  harmless over-read into adjacent static memory. §7a of the sAction map
  confirms flat memcpy is sufficient (no side heap).
- **cChr per-character RNG (+0x2D80)** — inside the flat char body. Covered.
- **sGSound voice-ID counter (0x140D5336C)** — audio-only nondeterminism
